<title>CHINA: Trade in Chevalier Int'l shrs suspend.</title>
<headline>Trade in Chevalier Int'l shrs suspend.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Chevalier International Holdings Ltd and Chevalier (OA) International Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the companies request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Chevalier International rose HK$0.375 or 16.67 percent to HK$2.625 at midday on volume of 36.66 million shares worth HK$92.91 million.</p>
<p>Chevalier (OA) shares rose HK$0.13 or 14.77 percent to HK$1.01 at midsession with 5.71 million shares changing hands.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
